    <item>
      <title>从非营利理想走向权力博弈：OpenAI的战略转型与AI治理的深层危机</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/openaiai-20250905164004781-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 05 Sep 2025 16:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
